      "en": "When they had stood Peter and John in the middle of them, they inquired, “By what power, or in what name, have you done this?”",
      "ko": "사도들을 가운데 세우고 묻되 너희가 무슨 권세와 뉘 이름으로 이 일을 행하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "5a5cdc4216c9eb8b6d08eb19dd078e0a178bfd463d8368ad7811fe21c30cfdd0",
