      "en": "if we are examined today concerning a good deed done to a crippled man, by what means this man has been healed,",
      "ko": "만일 병인에게 행한 착한 일에 대하여 이 사람이 어떻게 구원을 얻었느냐고 오늘 우리에게 질문하면",
      "source_text_hash": "857df37941f511e66c15d36f733110de3f8ec37f1fbff5485a61a975e9305ca2",
      "translation_text_hash": "721295cd1a6942b60048f1d05932b02b16443aea88b03859c27aadb82c068bc7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
